Error [E0120]: `hs` was not moved here, so this loop can't take its handles
  --> tests/ui/loop_two_binding_borrowed_task_list.jet:5:18
    |
  5 |     loop (i, h), hs { total += h.wait() + i }
    |                  ^^
 Why: each step hands you the handle itself, and a task handle cannot be copied — so the loop takes the whole list with the move-capability marker `^`
 Fix: take the list with the move-capability marker `^`: `hs: ^[Task<Int>]`, or drive the group without a loop: `hs.wait_all()`, `hs.cancel_all()`, `hs.pause_all()`
